{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Serious Image Problem", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Lunch Meeting", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Explain customs and appropriate behavior at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Responses with So and Neither", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use<span class=\"italic\"> so</span>  for <span class=\"italic\">positive </span>agreement and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for <span class=\"italic\">negative</span> agreement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">So</span> is used to show agreement with positive statements. <br />Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">too</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br /><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span><br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span><span class=\"italic\">: So do I/I do too.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Neither</span> is used to show agreement with negative statements. <br />Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <br /><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I don't think this fits well.</span> <br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Neither do I</span>. (<span class=\"italic\">neither </span>is a negative word)            <br /><span class=\"italic\">I don't either.</span> (<span class=\"italic\">either</span> is used with the negative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use<span class=\"italic\"> so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the auxiliary needs to agree with the verb tense in the original statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br />A more colloquial form of agreement is <span class=\"italic\">\u201cme too\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cme neither\u201d.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":12,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive Agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I need a pair of jeans.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I was inspired by a classy red dress.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So am I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd like something with a boot cut.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So would I!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've been dying to get to the mall.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Me too!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative Agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't look good in red.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Neither do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't gone shopping in a while.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Me neither!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't had a cocktail in ages.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't either.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Making Suggestions</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should, might</span> and phrases to make suggestions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should, ought to, had better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to make suggestions and recommendations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use phrases like:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How about + gerund/noun <br />What about + gerund/noun <br />You might be better off with + noun <br />Why don't you/we + base form verb <br />Have you thought about + gerund/noun ... <br />It's probably worth + gerund ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using the phrases above make your suggestion less direct. <br />They are more common in a formal conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Why don't we try it?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">You might be better off with a low waist. </span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">How about this stonewashed pair?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Have you thought about buying a dress for the wedding you're attending?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">It's probably worth checking it out.</span> ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take your mind off something", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to allow you to stop worrying about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Shopping helps you take your mind off things.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about clothing and styles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "low waist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the \u200bpart of a \u200bpiece of \u200bclothing that goes around or \u200bcovers the \u200barea between the \u200bhips and the \u200bribs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You might be better off with a low waist.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to suit someone ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look good on someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They really suit you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flattering", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making someone \u200blook or \u200bseem \u200bbetter or more \u200battractive than \u200busual", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I find A-line dresses flattering.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "classy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "stylish or fashionable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was inspired by a classy red dress I saw at the show. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pricey", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expensive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is 