], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I've been dying to get to the mall, Janet!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Me too! I haven't gone shopping in a while.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Me neither. Shopping helps you take your mind off things. I need a pair of jeans.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: So do I. But I'm looking for a designer pair. This store has a sale on jeans. Why don't we try it?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sure. Hmm \u2026 I'd like something with a bootcut.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: So would I. You might be better off with a low waist.", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm not sure. How about this stonewashed pair?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: They really suit you. I love them!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So do I. Have you thought about buying a dress for the wedding you're attending?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Not really. I find A-line dresses flattering, but I was inspired by a classy red dress I saw at the show.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Oh, so was I! It's probably worth checking it out. I'm sorry I don't look good in red! <br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Neither do I, but the style was just right. Maybe we should keep looking.", "id": 1, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn8le04ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. There's a nice boutique around the corner. I think we should consider paying it a visit.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Is it pricey? I'm cautious about spending too much on a dress I won't be wearing often.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So am I. It might be worth checking. When's the wedding?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: In a month. There's no rush. How about going for drinks after we have a quick look? I need to unwind. I haven't had a cocktail in ages.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Good idea! I haven't either!", "id": 2, "time": "59000", "image": "engenn8le04ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le04ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [{"content": 1, "type": "template_override"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}